A patient-facing assessment for a weight-management programme. It collects clinical information
through a conversation, then does one of three things: recommend a regimen, route the case to a
doctor, or stop. The third matters as much as the first.

Private company code. The clinical logic, eligibility criteria, drug names and thresholds are not
described here — this is the architecture and how changes to it were validated.

